# ponytail: force LF in the working tree. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows + a formatter that writes CRLF makes the edit tool's exact-substring
# match fail ("replacement produced identical content") whenever oldText is LF
# and the on-disk file has drifted to CRLF. eol=lf overrides autocrlf for git;
# .editorconfig covers formatters that don't read git attributes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
